                                                "sense_id": "5a5b9180-98f0-39a0-88d7-61098b028392",
                                                "text": "Most of my collection is near mint, but these ones here are mint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c018e58a-f0d5-4b9a-8e79-7683e5cd6df7",
                                                "sense_id": "5a5b9180-98f0-39a0-88d7-61098b028392",
                                                "text": "Trading card sales have taken off, too. The price of mint condition cards on StockX jumped to an average $775 in January from $280 a year ago."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f45956e-16e2-3c61-a528-d1c266b56e9c",
                                        "entry_id": "140dc12d-5ac9-3d75-86f4-1962512189d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In near-perfect condition; uncirculated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc07e1e5-6b88-34a2-a280-8476bb410e15",
                                        "entry_id": "140dc12d-5ac9-3d75-86f4-1962512189d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unused with original gum; as issued originally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ba7b739-c324-30c3-81a6-2397c62bebb6",
                                        "entry_id": "140dc12d-5ac9-3d75-86f4-1962512189d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very good, excellent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Geordie",
                                            "Northern-England",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a41e1e7-2149-45b2-8cbe-897017dc1573",
                                                "sense_id": "5ba7b739-c324-30c3-81a6-2397c62bebb6",
                                                "text": "And my God, what a house it was – it was mint! In all my life I had never set foot in such a beautiful place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "942a6df6-d9ba-4a12-a7e7-6fd3cd369e35",
                                                "sense_id": "5ba7b739-c324-30c3-81a6-2397c62bebb6",
                                                "text": "“Everyone was having a beano, everyone was partying, the music was going, it was mint – as soon as England won we booked it.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcc1b7b1-43ae-38a3-afff-d7b5d47e7b79",
